
@startuml
title SD3 - Pembayaran dan Serah Terima Pesanan

actor Pelanggan
actor "Staf Laundry" as Staf
participant "Halaman Lavora" as UI
participant "M01 - Autentikasi" as M01
participant "M02 - Pengelolaan Pesanan" as M02
participant "M04 - Status Laundry" as M04
participant "M05 - Pembayaran" as M05
participant "M06 - Serah Terima" as M06
participant "M07 - Notifikasi" as M07
participant Database as DB

Staf -> UI: Menyelesaikan laundry
UI -> M04: Perbarui status
M04 -> DB: Simpan status
DB --> M04: Berhasil
M04 -> M07: Kirim notifikasi
M07 --> Pelanggan: Informasi laundry selesai

Pelanggan -> UI: Melakukan pembayaran
UI -> M01: Validasi akses
M01 --> UI: Akses valid
UI -> M02: Ambil total biaya
M02 --> UI: Total biaya
UI -> M05: Catat pembayaran

alt Pembayaran berhasil
    M05 -> DB: Simpan pembayaran
    DB --> M05: Berhasil
    M05 --> UI: Konfirmasi pembayaran

    Staf -> UI: Memproses serah terima
    UI -> M06: Catat pengambilan/pengantaran
    M06 -> DB: Simpan metode serah terima
    DB --> M06: Berhasil

    M06 -> M04: Perbarui status pesanan
    M04 -> DB: Simpan status terbaru
    DB --> M04: Berhasil
    M04 -> M07: Kirim notifikasi
    M07 --> Pelanggan: Informasi status terbaru
else Pembayaran gagal
    M05 --> UI: Pembayaran gagal
    UI --> Pelanggan: Tampilkan pesan gagal
end

@enduml
